{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome! It\u2019s time to start your very own medieval manuscript workshop - the Scriptorium.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/9073bc894f80781fc87678290ad7e7da.poster.avif?t=1763976991\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/9073bc894f80781fc87678290ad7e7da.webm?t=1763976991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/9073bc894f80781fc87678290ad7e7da.mp4?t=1763976991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create amazing medieval illustrations! Fulfil orders from prestigious patrons by making your own designs on pages of medieval books. Create, get paid, and unlock new orders, design elements, and grow your workshop. And with time and practice, your works and fame may reach the Queen herself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/98bd889707e216e5963870925058a6b9.poster.avif?t=1763976991\" width=620 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/98bd889707e216e5963870925058a6b9.webm?t=1763976991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/98bd889707e216e5963870925058a6b9.mp4?t=1763976991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colourful cast of clients will send you their requests. Some might want illustrations depicting grand battles between snails and dogs. Some might want more quaint scenes of peace, love, and the plague. And some might come with, how should we put it, *cough*, more bizarre requests. But it is not up to you to judge! Oh no! Your duty is to have fun as you\u2019re fulfilling their wishes, your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/8ae85ed7d6d0786c553ae56663cfc273.poster.avif?t=1763976991\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/8ae85ed7d6d0786c553ae56663cfc273.webm?t=1763976991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/8ae85ed7d6d0786c553ae56663cfc273.mp4?t=1763976991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And as your illustrations spread across the land and your workshop grows in both stature and fame, you will create artworks fit for the ages, acclaimed by Kings, celebrated by Bards, and adored by historians for centuries to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/c956302a34e554a916fe5ce35694aa85.poster.avif?t=1763976991\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/c956302a34e554a916fe5ce35694aa85.webm?t=1763976991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/c956302a34e554a916fe5ce35694aa85.mp4?t=1763976991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create beautiful (or weird) medieval illustrations (or memes) and become the Queen\u2019s favourite artist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illustrate your own medieval manuscripts however you like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 1,000 unique elements to unlock and use </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow and personalise your workshop with buyable items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super-detailed manuscript sandbox where your creativity can reign supreme</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each illustration element is based on real-life medieval manuscript art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfil custom commissions from your favourite let\u2019s players and medieval content creators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export your in-game designs and create medieval memes to share with your friends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ink-in Scriptorium: Master of Manuscripts to your Steam Wishlist!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/e385d09ff85fa2b423a2bf3a56e9b85e.avif?t=1763976991\" width=620 height=194 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3119540?t=1763976991","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763976991","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763976991","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763976991","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join our community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/1a16b608af83d771c757e22f997fffa5.avif?t=1763976991\" width=620 height=108 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome! It\u2019s time to start your very own medieval manuscript workshop - the Scriptorium.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/9073bc894f80781fc87678290ad7e7da.poster.avif?t=1763976991\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/9073bc894f80781fc87678290ad7e7da.webm?t=1763976991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/9073bc894f80781fc87678290ad7e7da.mp4?t=1763976991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create amazing medieval illustrations! Fulfil orders from prestigious patrons by making your own designs on pages of medieval books. Create, get paid, and unlock new orders, design elements, and grow your workshop. And with time and practice, your works and fame may reach the Queen herself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/98bd889707e216e5963870925058a6b9.poster.avif?t=1763976991\" width=620 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/98bd889707e216e5963870925058a6b9.webm?t=1763976991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/98bd889707e216e5963870925058a6b9.mp4?t=1763976991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colourful cast of clients will send you their requests. Some might want illustrations depicting grand battles between snails and dogs. Some might want more quaint scenes of peace, love, and the plague. And some might come with, how should we put it, *cough*, more bizarre requests. But it is not up to you to judge! Oh no! Your duty is to have fun as you\u2019re fulfilling their wishes, your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/8ae85ed7d6d0786c553ae56663cfc273.poster.avif?t=1763976991\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/8ae85ed7d6d0786c553ae56663cfc273.webm?t=1763976991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119540/extras/8ae85ed7d6d0786c553ae56663cfc273.mp4?t=1763976991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And as your illustrations spread across the land and your workshop grows in both stature and fame, you will create artworks fit for the ages, acclaimed by Kings, celebrated by Bards, and adored by historians for centuries to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/